# sweep: --bare --seed-root apps/syncthing/fixtures/trouble
# After a sync that left copies of files changed on both sides, with notes
# and photos brought in. The runtime's words lead the screen.
wait-for Three files changed on both sides and were kept as copies.
expect Some files did not sync
expect Files not synced
expect Computers found
expect Added to Vault
expect 4 files
expect Added to Frame
expect 2 files
expect Folders
expect-missing Set up Sync
clean
shot syncthing-conflict
tap Folders
wait-for Sync folders
expect These four folders are fixed.
tap About
wait-for MPL-2.0
tap-id 4294967295
wait-for Sync folders
tap-id 4294967295
wait-for Some files did not sync
